                                                "sense_id": "bf3acf25-aa82-3a88-9828-b9f0d7b3d43f",
                                                "text": "That's a porno film."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5ea9cb7-0144-4152-960f-660b37efb984",
                                                "sense_id": "bf3acf25-aa82-3a88-9828-b9f0d7b3d43f",
                                                "text": "For reasons that still baffle me, “Deep Throat” became the one porno film in New York chic to see and to seen at, even before the court case, even before Earl Wilson wrote about it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5454ce62-f8ae-47b5-9dde-aef0e7cc18df",
                                                "sense_id": "bf3acf25-aa82-3a88-9828-b9f0d7b3d43f",
                                                "text": "[…]ultra-risqué pictures verging on the pornographic (the most porno of the last-named have not yet made it to the TV screen, but they are getting there fast—witness the storm of protests over the situation comedy “Soap”)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
